    "body": "## Problem\n\nAn empty message leaves `msg_ext_fast` disabled. With ui2 `msg.targets = 'msg'`, calling `inputlist()` after aborting the command line displays the list in the message window instead of beside its prompt.\n\n## Solution\n\nReset `msg_ext_fast` after emitting the empty message, as in other message flushes. Add a regression test for `inputlist()` after aborting the command line.\n\nFixes #42154.\n\nValidation: the regression test fails before the fix and passes after it. UI2: 35 passed. Message protocol: 86 passed, 1 skipped. UI callbacks: 14 passed. C lint, StyLua, commit lint, and `git diff --check` pass.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-15T00:09:45Z",
